  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&apos;s Voice and Leadership in Iraq</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will include three components. In the first component, two partner Women&apos;s Right Organisations (WROs) will participate in capacity sharing for organisational and technical development, especially on monitoring and evaluation, and for sustainability in fundraising. In the second component the two partner WROs will receive financial support (grants) to run women&apos;s safe space centres in key locations and run public campaigns and policy advocacy to eradicate Gender Based Violence (GBV) and promote women&apos;s participation. In the third component, the WROs with Oxfam and allies will participate in regional and global networking, advocacy and evidence -building initiatives as well as feminist retreats.</narrative>
  </description>
